<p>Conjures up a bolt of fire, setting the target ablaze and doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">178, 240, 287, 328, 364</acronym> fire damage over 3 turns.</p><p>At level 5, it will create a beam of flames.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>